'''Hardened''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Hardened's blade resembles the process of 'case hardening' being applied to all metal parts on the knife, giving it a unique gold and blue appearance. The handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==

* Hardened appearance is a reference to [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Counter-Strike Counter-Strike] case hardened texture.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Counter-Strike]

